From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: TurboVadim <yolkin.vadim@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 21 Jul 2026 03:35:30 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] Stabilize parallel world ticking

Join every submitted world tick before propagating failures and serialize buffered-read admission with world closure.

